{"content_kind":"narrative.vn","definition":{"id":"ch1_prologue","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"bgm":"res://assets/audio/bgm/ch1_forest.mp3","chapter":1,"title":"Chapter 1, Ash","title_ko":"1장, 재"},"steps":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_opening_aftermath.png","fade_ms":1500},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"narrate":"The beast was dead.","narrate_ko":"괴물은 죽어 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"fade_ms":1200},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"narrate":"Arrel stood over the stain it left behind, sword still raised, though there was nothing left to cut.","narrate_ko":"아렐은 그것이 남긴 얼룩 앞에 서 있었다. 검은 아직 치켜든 채였지만, 더 이상 벨 것은 없었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"narrate":"His skull throbbed. Not the clean pain of a headache but a deeper pressure, as if someone had scooped out a piece of his brain and left the cavity unsealed.","narrate_ko":"두개골이 욱신거렸다. 깨끗한 두통이 아니라, 뇌의 한 조각을 도려낸 뒤 그 빈자리를 봉합하지 않은 듯한 깊은 압박이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/illustration_expansion_v2/world_rewrite_reaching_hand_v3.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"narrate":"He watched his own hand for a long moment before he recognized it.","narrate_ko":"그는 한참 동안 자기 손을 바라본 뒤에야 그것이 자신의 손이라는 걸 알아보았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"system_log":"[COMBUSTION DETECTED: Type 1, Sensory Fragment]\n[LOCATION EST.: Rim Exterior, Achen Forest]\n[RESIDUAL RECORD: trace detected, fading]","system_log_ko":"[연소 감지: 유형 1, 감각 파편]\n[위치 추정: 림 외곽, 아켄 숲]\n[잔류 기록: 흔적 감지, 소실 중]"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_elia_reunion.png","fade_ms":1400,"portrait":"elia_worried","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Arrel.","text_ko":"아렐."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"narrate":"Her voice found him before her face did. Soft, close, and threaded with a fear she was trying not to spend.","narrate_ko":"그녀의 목소리가 얼굴보다 먼저 그를 찾아왔다. 부드럽고, 가까웠고, 쓰지 않으려 애쓰는 두려움이 섞여 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_shocked","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"...Elia?","text_ko":"...엘리아?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_gentle_smile","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Good. You kept that much.","text_ko":"좋아. 그 정도는 아직 남아 있네."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{"narrate":"His right hand twitched. It moved toward her before he could stop it, fingers uncurling from the sword grip, reaching for something his muscles remembered but his mind did not.","narrate_ko":"오른손이 움찔했다. 멈추기도 전에 그녀를 향해 움직였고, 검 손잡이를 쥔 손가락이 풀리며 머리는 잊었지만 근육은 기억하는 무언가를 향해 뻗었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/10","jump":null,"original_index":10,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":10,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":10,"text":{"narrate":"She did not step into the reach of the blade. She only lowered her lantern until the light caught the ash on his knuckles.","narrate_ko":"그녀는 칼날의 사정거리 안으로 들어오지 않았다. 대신 등불을 낮춰, 그의 손마디에 묻은 재가 빛에 드러나게 했다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/11","jump":null,"original_index":11,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":11,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":11,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"How bad?","text_ko":"얼마나 심해?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/12","jump":null,"original_index":12,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_default2","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":12,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":12,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"One burn. Grade three, maybe. Nothing I'll miss.","text_ko":"한 번 태웠어. 3등급쯤. 없어져도 아깝지 않은 거야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/13","jump":null,"original_index":13,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":13,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":13,"text":{"narrate":"That was probably true. That was probably a lie.","narrate_ko":"아마 사실이었다. 아마 거짓말이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/14","jump":null,"original_index":14,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":14,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":14,"text":{"narrate":"The problem with burning memories was that you could never be sure which it was.","narrate_ko":"기억을 태우는 일의 문제는, 어느 쪽인지 절대 확신할 수 없다는 데 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/15","jump":null,"original_index":15,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_ash_rain_touch.png","fade_ms":1300},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":15,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":15,"text":{"narrate":"Something touched his face.","narrate_ko":"무언가가 그의 얼굴에 닿았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/16","jump":null,"original_index":16,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":16,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":16,"text":{"narrate":"A gray flake, lighter than dust, dissolving against his skin with a faint warmth that was not his own.","narrate_ko":"먼지보다 가벼운 회색 조각 하나가 피부 위에서 녹아들었다. 희미한 온기가 있었지만, 그의 것은 아니었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/17","jump":null,"original_index":17,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":17,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":17,"text":{"narrate":"Ash Rain.","narrate_ko":"재비."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/18","jump":null,"original_index":18,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":18,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":18,"text":{"narrate":"It came down through the canopy in slow spirals, each flake carrying the residue of someone else's loss.","narrate_ko":"재는 나무 사이로 느린 나선처럼 떨어졌다. 조각마다 누군가가 잃어버린 것의 잔재를 품고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/19","jump":null,"original_index":19,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_cold","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":19,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":19,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Someone else's sorrow. Not mine. Not anymore.","text_ko":"다른 누군가의 슬픔. 내 것이 아니야. 이제는."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/20","jump":null,"original_index":20,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":20,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":20,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"We should move. The rain will get thicker after dark.","text_ko":"움직여야 해. 해가 지면 비가 더 짙어질 거야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/21","jump":null,"original_index":21,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_void_beast_emergence.png","fade_ms":1200},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":21,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":21,"text":{"narrate":"The ash thickened. Between the trees, something moved in the gray, too many limbs, too little shape.","narrate_ko":"재가 짙어졌다. 나무들 사이, 회색 속에서 무언가가 움직였다. 팔다리는 너무 많고, 형체는 너무 적었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/22","jump":null,"original_index":22,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_determined","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":22,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":22,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"They can smell warmth. Heat. Living things.","text_ko":"놈들은 온기를 맡아. 열. 살아 있는 것들."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/23","jump":null,"original_index":23,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":23,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":23,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"We can't outrun them. Not at this pace.","text_ko":"이 속도로는 따돌릴 수 없어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/24","jump":null,"original_index":24,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":24,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":24,"text":{"narrate":"A memory surfaced, unbidden. A song his mother used to hum by a campfire. Warm. Specific. His.","narrate_ko":"기억 하나가 불쑥 떠올랐다. 어머니가 모닥불 곁에서 흥얼거리던 노래. 따뜻하고, 또렷하고, 그의 것이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/25","jump":null,"original_index":25,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":25,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":25,"text":{"narrate":"He could burn it. Let the warmth of it spread into the ash and confuse the things that tracked him.","narrate_ko":"그는 그것을 태울 수 있었다. 그 온기를 재 속으로 퍼뜨려, 자신을 추적하는 것들을 혼란스럽게 만들 수 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"cost_memory":"daily_campfire_song","set_flag":"burned_for_passage"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/26/choice/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":0,"original_index":26,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Next battle: +18 Limit and +22 BREAK pressure.","effect_ko":"다음 전투: 리밋 +18, BREAK 압박 +22.","text":"The song for passage.","text_ko":"길을 열기 위해 노래를 태운다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"add_item":"smoke_bomb","set_flag":"refused_to_burn"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/26/choice/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":1,"original_index":26,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Gain 1 Smoke Bomb. Next battle: first enemy blow is guarded.","effect_ko":"연막탄 1개 획득. 다음 전투: 적의 첫 공격을 방어.","text":"Hold on to it. Find another way.","text_ko":"붙잡는다. 다른 길을 찾는다."}}],"choices_present":true,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/26","jump":null,"original_index":26,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":26,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":26,"text":{"choice_hint":"This decision changes the next battle. Burning memory is faster. Keeping it changes how Arrel survives.","choice_hint_ko":"이 결정은 다음 전투를 바꿉니다. 기억을 태우면 빠릅니다. 지키면 아렐이 살아남는 방식이 달라집니다.","choice_title":"WHAT WILL ARREL SPEND?","choice_title_ko":"아렐은 무엇을 대가로 치를까?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"burned_for_passage"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/27","jump":null,"original_index":27,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/illustration_expansion_v2/world_rewrite_campfire_song_v3.png","fade_ms":1200},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":27,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":27,"text":{"narrate":"He let the melody catch. For one breath, the forest smelled of smoke and old wood. Then the song was heat, then ash, then nothing.","narrate_ko":"그는 선율에 불을 붙였다. 한 호흡 동안 숲은 연기와 오래된 장작 냄새로 가득했다. 그리고 노래는 열이 되었고, 재가 되었고, 아무것도 아니게 되었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"burned_for_passage"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/28","jump":null,"original_index":28,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_sad","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":28,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":28,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"That was yours.","text_ko":"그건 네 것이었어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"burned_for_passage"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/29","jump":null,"original_index":29,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_cold","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":29,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":29,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"It got us through.","text_ko":"우릴 통과시켰잖아."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"refused_to_burn"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/30","jump":null,"original_index":30,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/archive_ch1_camp_humming_v2.png","fade_ms":1600},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":30,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":30,"text":{"narrate":"No fire. Fire drew attention, and attention out here meant things with too few memories and too many teeth.","narrate_ko":"불은 피우지 않았다. 불은 시선을 끌고, 이곳에서 시선은 기억은 너무 적고 이빨은 너무 많은 것들을 뜻했다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"refused_to_burn"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/31","jump":null,"original_index":31,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":31,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":31,"text":{"narrate":"His hand was still shaking.","narrate_ko":"그의 손은 아직 떨리고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{"requires_flag":"refused_to_burn"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/32","jump":null,"original_index":32,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":32,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":32,"text":{"narrate":"He pressed it flat against his knee and held it there until the tremors became indistinguishable from his own heartbeat.","narrate_ko":"그는 손을 무릎에 눌러 붙이고, 떨림이 자신의 심장 박동과 구분되지 않을 때까지 버텼다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"add_grains":6,"set_flag":"thought_about_bl07"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/33/choice/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":0,"original_index":33,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Gain 6 Grains by recalling a Bureau route marker.","effect_ko":"관리국 경로 표식을 떠올려 그레인 6 획득.","text":"Think about BL-07.","text_ko":"BL-07을 생각한다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"heal_player":8,"set_flag":"listened_to_humming"},"gate":{"requires_memory_intact":"daily_campfire_song"},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/33/choice/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":1,"original_index":33,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Recover up to 8 HP. Next battle: +10 Limit from Anchor focus.","effect_ko":"HP를 최대 8 회복. 다음 전투: 닻 집중으로 리밋 +10.","text":"Listen to Elia's humming.","text_ko":"엘리아의 허밍을 듣는다."}},{"action":{},"effect_phase":"cost_then_flags_burn_rewards_blocking","effects":{"add_item":"firebomb","set_flag":"tried_to_remember"},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/33/choice/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":2,"original_index":33,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"text":{"effect":"Gain 1 Firebomb from the heat left in the ash.","effect_ko":"재 속에 남은 열기로 화염탄 1개 획득.","text":"Try to remember what you burned.","text_ko":"무엇을 태웠는지 기억하려 한다."}}],"choices_present":true,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/33","jump":null,"original_index":33,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":33,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":33,"text":{"choice_hint":"Small choices set Arrel's opening resources and emotional footing.","choice_hint_ko":"작은 선택은 아렐의 시작 자원과 마음의 버팀목을 정합니다.","choice_title":"WHAT KEEPS HIM MOVING?","choice_title_ko":"무엇이 그를 계속 걷게 하는가?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/34","jump":null,"original_index":34,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_calm","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":34,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":34,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"You're quiet tonight.","text_ko":"오늘 밤은 조용하네."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/35","jump":null,"original_index":35,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_pensive","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":35,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":35,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"I'm quiet every night.","text_ko":"난 매일 밤 조용해."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/36","jump":null,"original_index":36,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_sad","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":36,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":36,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Quieter than that.","text_ko":"그보다 더 조용해."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/37","jump":null,"original_index":37,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/archive_ch1_camp_humming_v2.png","fade_ms":1200},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":37,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":37,"text":{"distort_if_burned":"daily_campfire_song","distorted_narrate":"After a while she began to hum. He waited for the melody to mean something. It didn't.","distorted_narrate_ko":"잠시 후 그녀가 흥얼거리기 시작했다. 그는 그 선율이 무언가를 뜻하길 기다렸다. 하지만 아무 의미도 없었다.","narrate":"After a while she began to hum. A low melody, threadbare at the edges.","narrate_ko":"잠시 후 그녀가 흥얼거리기 시작했다. 낮고, 가장자리가 해진 선율이었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/38","jump":null,"original_index":38,"presentation":{"distorted_portrait":"arrel_cold","portrait":"arrel_neutral","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":38,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":38,"text":{"distort_if_burned":"daily_campfire_song","distorted_text":"...Is that a song? It sounds like one. I can't tell.","distorted_text_ko":"...그거 노래야? 노래 같긴 한데. 모르겠어.","speaker":"Arrel","text":"...I know that song.","text_ko":"...그 노래 알아."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/39","jump":null,"original_index":39,"presentation":{"distorted_portrait":"elia_sad","portrait":"elia_hopeful","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":39,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":39,"text":{"distort_if_burned":"daily_campfire_song","distorted_text":"...You used to know it.","distorted_text_ko":"...너는 예전에 그걸 알고 있었어.","speaker":"Elia","text":"Your mother used to hum it. By the fire. You told me once.","text_ko":"네 어머니가 흥얼거리던 노래야. 불가에서. 네가 전에 말해줬어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/40","jump":null,"original_index":40,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":40,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":40,"text":{"narrate":"He closed his eyes.","narrate_ko":"그는 눈을 감았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/41","jump":null,"original_index":41,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":41,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":41,"text":{"narrate":"Morning would come. The Belt waited ahead. And somewhere beyond it, the answers he was trading himself to find.","narrate_ko":"아침은 올 것이다. 벨트가 앞에 기다리고 있었다. 그리고 그 너머 어딘가에, 그가 자기 자신과 맞바꾸며 찾는 답이 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/42","jump":null,"original_index":42,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch1_twisted_forest_path.png","fade_ms":2000},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":42,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":42,"text":{"narrate":"At dawn, the ash had thickened into a fine carpet over everything.","narrate_ko":"새벽이 되자 재는 모든 것 위에 고운 융단처럼 쌓여 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/43","jump":null,"original_index":43,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_determined","side":"right"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":43,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":43,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"There's movement ahead. More of them. We can go around, or through.","text_ko":"앞쪽에 움직임이 있어. 더 많아. 돌아갈 수도 있고, 뚫고 갈 수도 있어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/44","jump":null,"original_index":44,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_determined","side":"left"},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":44,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":44,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Through. Lose the trail, lose days.","text_ko":"뚫고 간다. 지금 흔적을 놓치면 며칠을 잃어."}},{"action":{"action":"goto_scene","id":"ch1_forest_walk"},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"effects_then_gate_then_rewards","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"vn/ch1_prologue/45","jump":null,"original_index":45,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"vn","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":45,"source_file":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","source_hash":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":45,"text":{}}]},"dialect":"vn","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"b3d63b12fe1aad5e5b42b53874c1432d449954432e7461b80ec5e90fcfcdf95a","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/vn_scenes/ch1_prologue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"7f7e8248cf414fa8112641a140f31c3ab1a64e8ab5492946f805f81f81449d18"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
